<title>SOUTH KOREA: Hyundai Engineering '96 net falls.</title>
<headline>Hyundai Engineering '96 net falls.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in billion won unless stated)</p>
<p>							   1996	  1995</p>
<p>    Shr (won)					402    vs   495</p>
<p>    Net						 21.13 vs    23.04</p>
<p>    Turnover				     4,732.08 vs 3,847.30</p>
<p>Dividend in cash (pct, par 5,000 won)</p>
<p>	preferred shares			     1    vs     1</p>
<p>    Dividend in stocks (pct)		     2    vs     2</p>
<p>    Profit before tax			     30.70 vs    33.46</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries (both gain)		  0.43 vs     5.08</p>
<p>NOTE - Hyundai Engineering and Construction Co is a unit of the Hyundai Group  and South Korea's leading contractor. Its share capital increased by 8.04 million shares to 58.76 million in 1996 due to issues of global depositary receipts, dividend payments in stocks and rights offering.</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5646</p>
</text>
